+    sudo dnf install python3 gcc SDL3-devel SDL3_ttf-devel SDL3_image-devel zenity
   Arch:
-    sudo pacman -S python gcc sdl2 sdl2_ttf sdl2_image zenity
+    sudo pacman -S python gcc sdl3 sdl3_ttf sdl3_image zenity
 
 COMO SE USA
